# --- artifact repo: source and reproducible outputs only ---
# Internal working documents are deliberately excluded (double-blind + they are not needed
# to replay the work): reviews, planning, decision logs, daily notes, status reports.
# Preregistrations ARE included: they are the record that each experiment's cells, models and
# analysis were declared before its results existed, which the paper cites as a control.
DECISIONS.md
PAPER_CLAIMS.md
RESEARCH_STATUS.md
notes/
wsdm2027_*.md
Must-Reference*.md
figures/*_caption.md

# Run outputs ARE included: every figure and every number in the paper is regenerated from
# runs/*/results.jsonl and the stored traces, so the artifact would not replay without them.
# Superseded sweeps are kept under explicit names (…_INVALID_…, …_PRE_AMENDMENT) because the
# paper states they are retained rather than deleted; the analysis scripts exclude them by name.
# Console logs and rescore backups are excluded: they are not reproduction artifacts.
runs/*.log
runs/**/*.bak-*

# generated
data/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store

# LaTeX build artifacts
paper/*.aux
paper/*.log
paper/*.out
paper/*.bbl
paper/*.blg
paper/*.fls
paper/*.fdb_latexmk
